    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Let's have fun playing rock-paper-scissors with Santa!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you win a game of rock-paper-scissors with Santa?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to win 5 times in a row!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Overview:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big game of rock-paper-scissors with Santa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas night, a beautiful Santa girl suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player demands \u2018Santa's underpants\u2019, which is an insane turn of events!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main game content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While reading the novel part of the game, the player challenges to a total of five rock-paper-scissors-paper games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes depending on who wins or loses the Janken matches in a multi-ending format.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short but rich dialogue.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes many exclusive dialogues and situations depending on the winners and losers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the characters' different facial expressions and comical reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy-to-play controls for everyone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use controls, even for novice novelists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only click to play rock-paper-scissors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comical and light-hearted BGM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of bright, fast-paced songs and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds switch from scene to scene, further accelerating the tempo of the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time (reference).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story specification of about 5 minutes per week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Let's have fun playing rock-paper-scissors with Santa!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you win a game of rock-paper-scissors with Santa?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is very simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to win 5 times in a row!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Overview:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big game of rock-paper-scissors with Santa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas night, a beautiful Santa girl suddenly appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player demands \u2018Santa's underpants\u2019, which is an insane turn of events!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main game content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While reading the novel part of the game, the player challenges to a total of five rock-paper-scissors-paper games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story changes depending on who wins or loses the Janken matches in a multi-ending format.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Short but rich dialogue.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes many exclusive dialogues and situations depending on the winners and losers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the characters' different facial expressions and comical reactions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy-to-play controls for everyone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use controls, even for novice novelists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only click to play rock-paper-scissors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Comical and light-hearted BGM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of bright, fast-paced songs and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds switch from scene to scene, further accelerating the tempo of the story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time (reference).</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story specification of about 5 minutes per week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translated with  (free version)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
